    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your chants wreath your body in holy flame. Anyone attempting to strike you with a handheld weapon must succeed on a <strong>Challenging (+0) Willpower</strong> Test or take a &ndash;30 penalty to their WS Skill Test as the heat drives them back from the attack. Even a successful test imposes a &ndash;10 penalty. Whilst wreath of flame is in effect, you are immune to all damage from non-magical fire.</p>"
